faqs:
  - q: "Can members apply for a loan themselves?"
    a: "Yes, in Coop Member. They choose the loan type, see what it will cost, name their guarantors and add the documents. Staff can also apply for a member."
  - q: "Do guarantors need the app?"
    a: "Members who guarantee a loan answer in Coop Member. Staff can also record a guarantor’s agreement at the branch. Guarantors who aren’t members sign your society’s paper form."
  - q: "Can we set our own interest rates and limits?"
    a: "Yes. Each loan type has its own interest, loan period, amounts and documents. On Professional and up, you also choose the approval steps and who approves each one."
  - q: "How do members repay?"
    a: "At the branch, where staff record it. Or from Coop Member, online or by bank transfer, if your society takes payments in the app."
